-- title:
--   Morphisms out of a trace-generated deformation are determined by traces
-- statement:
--   Fix a finite index type $n$, a topological group $G$, and a commutative ring $\mathcal O$. Let $A$ and $B$ be objects of [`Deformation.ProartinianCat`](def/Deformations_ProartinianCat.html#L44) $\mathcal O$, i.e. types carrying a commutative ring structure, a topology and an $\mathcal O$-algebra structure such that the algebra is a topological ring, a local ring, pro-Artinian, the structure map $\mathcal O \to A$ is a local homomorphism and $A$ is a residue algebra over $\mathcal O$; let $f, g \colon A \to B$ be two morphisms of this category, that is, continuous $\mathcal O$-algebra homomorphisms of the underlying algebras. Let $\sigma \colon G \to \mathrm{GL}_n(A)$ be a continuous monoid homomorphism. Assume that [`Deformation.traceSubalgebra`](def/Deformations_TraceAlgebra.html#L56) of $\sigma$ is the whole of $A$, i.e. that the topological closure of the $\mathcal O$-subalgebra generated by the set of traces $\{\operatorname{tr}\sigma(g) : g \in G\}$ equals $\top$; and assume that $f$ and $g$ agree on every such trace, $f(\operatorname{tr}\sigma(x)) = g(\operatorname{tr}\sigma(x))$ for all $x \in G$. The conclusion is $f = g$ as morphisms $A \to B$.
--
--   This is the uniqueness half of the trace-algebra approach to representability of unframed deformation functors: a morphism out of an object topologically generated over $\mathcal O$ by the traces of a continuous representation is pinned down by its values on those traces. It is used by [`Deformation.hom_ext_of_mk_mapRepn_eq`](thm.html#Deformation.hom_ext_of_mk_mapRepn_eq), which deduces equality of morphisms carrying a trace-generated lift to strictly equivalent lifts.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_Deformation_hom_ext_of_traceSubalgebra_eq_top.lean

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_Deformations_TraceAlgebra

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

open CategoryTheory IsLocalRing

universe u v

theorem Deformation.hom_ext_of_traceSubalgebra_eq_top {n : Type} [Fintype n] [DecidableEq n] {G : Type u} [Group G]
    [TopologicalSpace G] {𝓞 : Type u} [CommRing 𝓞] {A B : Deformation.ProartinianCat 𝓞} {f g : A ⟶ B} {σ : G →ₜ* GL n A}
    (hσ : Deformation.traceSubalgebra 𝓞 σ = ⊤)
    (h : ∀ x : G, f.hom (Matrix.trace ((σ x : GL n A) : Matrix n n A)) =
      g.hom (Matrix.trace ((σ x : GL n A) : Matrix n n A))) : f = g := by sorry
